The <divergence> sums the corresponding <partial derivatives>:
$$
\nabla\cdot\mathbf F=\frac{\partial(xy^2)}{\partial x}
+\frac{\partial0}{\partial y}+\frac{\partial0}{\partial z}
=\boxed{y^2}.
$$

= b
{parent=8}
